## Stdlib at a glance

User programs can call any of these without an import:

```
print, input
list, len, get, set, push, pop, dict, has, keys, range
str, split, join, upper, lower, replace
int, float
read_file, write_file, argv, exit
```

See the full reference in the `{{ lang_name }}` package's `LANGUAGE.md`.

